      "content": "thanks, that is much more helpful. please finish the communication part and then add a section on team coordination. specifically, what should the nurses do if a patient becomes particularly erratic or starts acting in a way that is just completely irrational and disruptive to the unit? we need to know how to manage those specific, troublesome personalities when they are being a nuisance to everyone's work.",
